sentences.text:
This petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India has been filed by the petitioner seeking following reliefs:-
"(i) That, the present petition filed by the petitioner may kindly be allowed;
(ii) That, the respondents may kindly be directed to make the payment of compensation along with interest at the rate of 15% per annum under section 80 of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 as the amount has not been paid within the period of one year.

